# Guide layout standards

Public guide **chapters** (playbooks, workshops, hub bodies). Companion to [`responsive-layouts.mdc`](responsive-layouts.mdc) (shell tiers) and [`guide-pdfs.mdc`](guide-pdfs.mdc) (print). Out-of-scope growth notes: [`docs/audit/guide-layout-growth-backlog.md`](../../docs/audit/guide-layout-growth-backlog.md).

Import from `@/components/comms/guide-ui` (or the named modules it re-exports).

## Shell vs chapter

| Layer | Use |
|-------|-----|
| `GuideLayout` + `preset` | Page frame: `narrow` / `playbook` / `hub` |
| `GuideSection` + children | Chapter body inside the article column |
| `GuideOutlineStep` / `GuideOutlineList` | Numbered workshop / first-week roadmap steps (not anonymous `border-l` `<li>`s) |
| `GuideAccentBlock` | Nested h3/h4 accent strips inside a chapter |
| `GuideWorkshopNote` | Facilitator / attendee workshop callouts |
| `GuideTrainingPhase` | Steward-101 numbered training modules only — not default playbook chrome |

Playbooks: `preset="playbook"` → `readWide` + TOC rail. **Fill the article column** after the rail — do not leave a phone-width stack with empty right space.

## Prose vs cluster

| Content | Primitive / pattern |
|---------|---------------------|
| Title, continuous intro, mid-section paragraphs | `max-w-prose` via section intro or `GuideProse` |
| Labeled tip / principle / checklist clusters | `GuideTipGrid` + `GuideTipItem` (`sm:grid-cols-2`; `columns={3}` only for short cards) |
| Label-less disc lists | `GuideBulletList` (optional `columns={2}` when items are short) |
| Diagrams / flow figures | `GuideWideFigure` — full article width; never `max-w-md` phone plates on desktop |
| CTA / button rows | `GuideActionRow` — no `max-w-lg` dead zone |

## Rhythm & human feel

- Section spacing: `not-first:mt-10 lg:not-first:mt-12`; in-section `mt-3` / `mt-6` / `mt-8` + `gap-4` (or `dense` tip grids on very long pages).
- Vary 2- vs 3-column; keep long narrative tips at 2-col.
- Asymmetry is good (prose + wide figure). Avoid identical bordered cards on every tip.
- Type: shared fluid headings on `GuideLayout` / `GuideSection` — clear steward voice, not marketing-hero display type.

## Hard rejects

- Page-local `function GuideSection` / `TipItem` / `ItemList` copies
- Tip `<ul>` wrapped in or items locked to `max-w-prose` inside a playbook article column
- Stretched mobile single column with growing empty half at `lg+`
- Robotic equal card grids for every list
- Blindly applying playbook grids to Officer Learning dark shell, narrow legal pages, tool panels, or PDF layout — see growth backlog

## Checklist (new or refactored guide)

- [ ] Imports shared guide-ui primitives (no local section/tip helpers)
- [ ] Intros stay readable; clusters fill the column at `sm+`
- [ ] Diagrams use `GuideWideFigure` when present
- [ ] Spot-checked ~375 / 768 / 1280 / 1536
- [ ] EN/FR untouched unless copy moves (then [`i18n-public-copy.mdc`](i18n-public-copy.mdc))
